## 4. Voice Schema Overrides

```yaml
voice_schema:
  character_id: "<char_id>"
  narrative_pov: "First Person Limited" # or "Third Person Deep Limited"
  cognitive_bias: "<Cognitive Bias Description>"
  vocabulary_matrix:
    register: "<Formal, Street, Tactical, Corporate, Metaphysical, etc.>"
    jargon_density: "<Low | Medium | High>"
    forbidden_tropes:
      - "<Phrase or behavior character would never use>"
    metaphor_domains:
      - "<Metaphor Domain 1, e.g., firearms, code, fashion, spirit threads>"
      - "<Metaphor Domain 2>"
  sensory_lens:
    primary_sense: "<AR Overlay, Thermal, Astral Aura, Auditory, Tactile>"
    secondary_sense: "<Secondary Sensory Focus>"
    blind_spots: "<What character misses or ignores>"
  emotional_baseline:
    default_affect: "<Affect Style>"
    stress_triggers:
      - "<Trigger 1>"
      - "<Trigger 2>"
    defense_mechanisms:
      - "<Defense Behavior 1>"
  syntax_cadence:
    sentence_length: "<Short & clipped, Rhythmic, Analytical>"
    paragraph_flow: "<Observation -> Action -> Evaluation>"
    internal_monologue: "<Internal Thought Style>"
```

